# Anthropic API key for AI scene analysis (/capture, scene page "AI로 분석하기").
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/ , paste it after the = sign, then restart the server.
# This file is git-ignored and never sent to the browser.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# TMDB (The Movie Database) - movie search, posters and backdrops on /search.
# Free for non-commercial use: https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
# Use EITHER the "API Read Access Token" (preferred) OR the v3 "API Key".
TMDB_READ_ACCESS_TOKEN=
TMDB_API_KEY=

# Access PIN gate. Set your own PIN; generate a secret with: openssl rand -hex 32
APP_PIN=
APP_SESSION_SECRET=
